# PROJECT: HAWASA GEBEYA
## Complete Mobile Marketplace Rebuild Using React Native, Expo, TypeScript, and Firebase

Act as a senior mobile application architect, senior React Native engineer, Firebase specialist, UI/UX designer, security engineer, and software testing engineer.

Your task is to rebuild my existing application, Affin Gebeya, into a production-oriented mobile marketplace called HAWASA GEBEYA.

Do not simply redesign the old website or create a static prototype. Build a functional mobile application with real Firebase integration, authentication, database operations, image uploads, product discovery, shopping cart, order management, notifications, and a scalable architecture.

The target market is Hawassa, Sidama Region, Ethiopia.

The main goal is to connect customers with local shops in Hawassa, allowing customers to discover nearby products, communicate with shops where appropriate, place orders, and arrange pickup or delivery.

The application must be optimized for Android first while maintaining a clean architecture that supports iOS.

